---
import WhatsAppButton from "./WhatsAppButton.astro";
---

<section id="topo" class="dark-surface min-h-screen pt-24">
  <div class="section-shell relative z-10 grid min-h-[calc(100vh-6rem)] items-center gap-12 py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr] lg:gap-14">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="display-title max-w-4xl text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4.6rem)] leading-[1.06] text-white">
        <span class="hero-title-line"><span>Somos a sua</span></span>
        <span class="hero-title-line"><span>segurança 24hrs</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-copy mt-7 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-white/74 sm:text-lg">
        Segurança de verdade é ter quem monitora, acompanha e age. Seu patrimônio com tecnologia avançada, monitoramento constante e suporte local especializado.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <WhatsAppButton />
        <a class="secondary-button" href="#solucoes">Ver soluções</a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-assurance mt-10 grid max-w-3xl sm:grid-cols-3">
        {["8 anos de experiência", "Monitoramento 24h", "Atendimento no Piauí"].map((item) => (
          <div class="hero-badge px-4 py-3">
            <span class="hero-badge__line mb-2 block h-px w-8 bg-gray-line"></span>
            <span class="text-sm font-bold text-white/84">{item}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="hero-visual relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/14 bg-graphite shadow-panel">
      <img
        class="hero-image aspect-[4/3] h-full w-full object-cover object-center lg:aspect-[4/5]"
        src="/images/hero-fachada-hs-seg.jpg"
        alt="Fachada da HS SEG no Piauí com a marca e câmera de segurança instalada"
        width="900"
        height="1600"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/24 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      <span class="hero-scan" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hero-reticle" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span>
      <div class="hero-status" aria-label="Atendimento local no Piauí">
        <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Operação local</span>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
